# Approval items the team approved before the event (docs/Conventions.md,
# sections 2.2 and 3.1). Optional: without this file, every approval item
# waits for a person or an --approve entry.
#
# One rule per line: module-id category item
#   item is an item id from a plan, or * for every item of the category.
# A rule counts only for a category the module's module.yml lists in
# pre_approvable; any other rule is ignored, with a line saying so.
# Each approved item is still checked against this run's plan, the
# module's own checks, the probes and the revert timer.
#
# Placeholders only. Replace them with the module ids, categories and item
# ids your team reviewed.

# lockout.example-patching security-update example-package
# lockout.example-app-credentials default-app-password example-app-admin
